# Keep build context lean and secrets out of the image (Railway injects env
# at runtime). Applies to the repo-root build context (the Node API/worker).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
.git
.github
**/*.log
playwright-report
test-results
**/coverage
